<title>THAILAND: Thai finmin Amnuay likely to resign June 19 - aide.</title>
<headline>Thai finmin Amnuay likely to resign June 19 - aide.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's embattled Finance Minister Amnuay Viravan is likely to resign from his post on Thursday, a senior government official said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Sornchai Montriwat, deputy secretary general to the prime minister for political affairs, was speaking to reporters after meeting Amnuay at his house.</p>
